<title>GERMANY: Gehe to pay 30 pfg extra on 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Gehe to pay 30 pfg extra on 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>German pharmaceutical wholesaler Gehe AG said on Wednesday it planned to pay a 1996 dividend of one mark per share plus a special payout of 30 pfennigs per share.</p>
<p>In a mandatory statement Gehe said it planned the extra dividend to enable shareholders to participate in the extraordinary earnings generated by the sale of its phamaceutical production division.</p>
<p>The statement was released after a meeting of Gehe's supervisory board.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
